# Candidate-stage snapshot bytes are NOT tracked in Git (corrective 1, PR #34
# review finding 4). They are reconstructed locally from the frozen lock by
#   python3 tools/acquire.py materialize
# and verified byte-exactly against the hash-pinned SOURCE.json manifests:
#   python3 tools/acquire.py verify --full
# Only the final frozen benchmark corpus (a later, separately reviewed
# campaign) will receive a tracked-storage decision, governed per source by
# storage_policy in acquisition-config.json.
_cache/
sources/*/files/
